<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill cuts Apple long-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill cuts Apple long-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut Apple Computer Inc to long-term reduce from neutral but retained its near-term neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not avaiable to comment.</p>
</text>
